Interpretation: if |order-6 - order-2| is itself small (comparable to or
smaller than the residual |order-2 - E_heuristic|), the four extra exact
orders included here do not materially shift the extrapolated limit --
consistent with (not a proof of) Estagio 26's truncation being adequate
at the order that determines E(gamma). A LARGE |order-6-order-2| would be
an important red flag this script is designed to catch honestly.
